        <category>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[BPO]]></Value>
    </category>
        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Most customer experiences don’t fall apart all at once. They lose consistency over time through small inconsistencies, growing friction, and interactions that make people feel like just another ticket.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
